        "content": "<p>epitaphial opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15327\">issue #15327</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1>wasi-preview1-component-adapter: fd_renumber can associate a cached directory stream with the wrong descriptor</h1>\n<h2>Summary</h2>\n<p><code>fd_renumber</code> replaces a descriptor without transferring or invalidating the global <code>dirent_cache</code>. A subsequent <code>fd_readdir</code> on the target FD can therefore resume the old directory's stream and return entries from the wrong directory.</p>\n<h2>Minimal reproducer</h2>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"C\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;fcntl.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;string.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;sys/stat.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;unistd.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;wasi/api.h&gt;</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">static</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">make_dir</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">mkdir</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mo\">0755</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">child</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">64</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">snprintf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">child</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">sizeof</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">child</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"%s/%s\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">close</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">open</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">child</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">O_CREAT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">O_WRONLY</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mo\">0644</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">unsigned</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">small</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">23</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">large</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">4096</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">__wasi_size_t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">used1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">used2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">make_dir</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"a\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"from-a.txt\"</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">make_dir</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"b\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"from-b.txt\"</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">open</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"a\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">O_RDONLY</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">O_DIRECTORY</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">open</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"b\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">O_RDONLY</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">O_DIRECTORY</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">__wasi_fd_readdir</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">small</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">sizeof</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">small</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">used1</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">__wasi_errno_t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">moved</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">__wasi_fd_renumber</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">__wasi_fd_readdir</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">large</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">sizeof</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">large</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">used2</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">printf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"renumber=%u used=%u</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">moved</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">unsigned</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"n\">used2</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">size_t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">off</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">off</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">sizeof</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">__wasi_dirent_t</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">used2</span><span class=\"p\">;)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">__wasi_dirent_t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">entry</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">memcpy</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">entry</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">large</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">off</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">sizeof</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">entry</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">off</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">sizeof</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">entry</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">entry</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">d_namlen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">used2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">break</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">printf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"entry: %.*s</span><span class=\"se\">\\n</span><span class=\"s\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"n\">entry</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">d_namlen</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">large</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">off</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">sizeof</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">entry</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">off</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">sizeof</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">entry</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">entry</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">d_namlen</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Run with the standard P1-to-component adaptation commands:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Bash\"><pre><span></span><code>/opt/wasi-sdk/bin/clang<span class=\"w\"> </span>--target<span class=\"o\">=</span>wasm32-wasip1<span class=\"w\"> </span>-O2<span class=\"w\"> </span>repro.c<span class=\"w\"> </span>-o<span class=\"w\"> </span>repro.wasm\nwasm-tools<span class=\"w\"> </span>component<span class=\"w\"> </span>new<span class=\"w\"> </span>repro.wasm<span class=\"w\"> </span>--adapt<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">wasi_snapshot_preview1</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>wasi_snapshot_preview1.command.wasm<span class=\"w\"> </span>-o<span class=\"w\"> </span>repro.component.wasm\nwasmtime<span class=\"w\"> </span>run<span class=\"w\"> </span>--dir<span class=\"w\"> </span>.<span class=\"w\"> </span>repro.wasm\nwasmtime<span class=\"w\"> </span>run<span class=\"w\"> </span>--dir<span class=\"w\"> </span>.<span class=\"w\"> </span>repro.component.wasm\n</code></pre></div>\n<h2>Expected vs. actual output</h2>\n<p>Direct P1:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Text only\"><pre><span></span><code>entries: . .. from-b.txt\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Adapter:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Text only\"><pre><span></span><code>entries: . .. . from-a.txt\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The behavior was stable in 5/5 fresh-directory executions on each of v46 Release, v46 Debug, v47.0.2, and v50.0.1.</p>\n<h2>Root cause</h2>\n<p>In the v46 baseline, <code>lib.rs:1578-1580</code> directly delegates <code>fd_renumber</code> to <code>Descriptors::renumber</code>; <code>descriptors.rs:356-384</code> replaces the descriptor without updating <code>dirent_cache</code>. The cache is subsequently selected using only <code>for_fd</code> and <code>cookie</code> at <code>lib.rs:1350-1356</code>. The same delegation remains at v50.0.1 <code>lib.rs:1621-1623</code>.</p>\n<p>This is distinct from the truncated-entry ordering issue in #15297: here descriptor identity changes, and the observed stream belongs to a different directory.</p>\n<h2>Suggested fix and causal validation</h2>\n<p>Drop the cached directory stream whenever either renumber endpoint matches <code>dirent_cache.for_fd</code>, then perform the descriptor move.</p>\n<p>The minimal patch passed the following experiment:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Unpatched: 3/3 executions diverged from P1.</li>\n<li>Patched: 3/3 executions exactly matched P1.</li>\n<li>Reverted: 3/3 executions diverged again, and both source and Adapter SHA-256 matched the unpatched build.<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>",
